        "near_end": true,
        "prefix_token_count": 907,
        "step_number": 8,
        "text": "Step 8: Solve the second equation for $y$:\n\\[\n\\frac{3 + y}{2} = \\frac{y}{3}\n\\]\nMultiply both sides by 6:\n\\[\n3(3 + y) = 2y\n\\]\n\\[\n9 + 3y = 2y\n\\]\n\\[\ny = -9\n\\]"
